x960-56YSQ#show platform classifier statistics utilization brief
  Loop Detection      2
  ACL                 5
  Total               7 / 1024 (0.68%)      <-- baseline was 2 / 1024
x960-56YSQ#show platform counter sdma
              0 : sdmaRegs.rxDmaPcktCnt[0]
              0 : sdmaRegs.rxDmaByteCnt[0]
              0 : sdmaRegs.rxDmaPcktCnt[1]  <-- no CPU-bound traffic, as expected: this case
                                                uses deny and permit only, with no
                                                copy-to-cpu or send-to-cpu action
  => STEP 6 PASS: five bound rules consume exactly five ingress classifier entries -- one per
